THE MINISTER OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY AND MINISTER OF EARTH SCIENCES (SHRI KAPIL SIBAL): Sir, I beg to lay the statement in pursuance of Direction 73A of hon. Speaker, Lok Sabha under rule 389 of the Rules of Procedure and Conduct of Business in Lok Sabha (Eleventh edition), to inform the esteemed House about the status of implementation of recommendations made by the Departmentally-related Parliamentary Standing Committee on Science and Technology, Environment and Forest in its 196th Report related to the comments on the 190th Action Taken Report tabled earlier. 

